# Pages are directories (about/index.html), served at /about/ — measured, not
# assumed: with no flat about.html present, Netlify answers /about/ with 200 and
# 301s /about to it.
#
# Do NOT add flat about.html forwarders alongside. Netlify resolves /about to the
# flat file in preference to the directory, which inverts the redirect and makes
# the forwarder bounce into itself. That broke every nav link once already.
/about.html        /about/        301!
/treatments.html   /treatments/   301!
/quiz.html         /quiz/         301!
/reviews.html      /reviews/      301!
